@@ -78,7 +78,7 @@ Since multi-valued RDNs are very rarely used B<set> typically will be zero.
 
 X509_NAME_add_entry_by_txt(), X509_NAME_add_entry_by_OBJ(),
 X509_NAME_add_entry_by_NID() and X509_NAME_add_entry() return 1 for
